'''Gingerscythe''' is an [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] knife that was obtainable in the [[Christmas Event 2023|2023 Christmas Event]] by purchasing the [[Gingerscythe Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux, When purchased, the knife starts out as a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] but when the player gains more [[XP]] [[File:XP Symbol.png|25x25px]] , it evolves into a knife of higher rarity, once purchased this knife can not be [[Trading|traded]] to other players.  

== Appearance ==
=== Variant 1 ===
The first variant uses the [[Default Knife]] mesh. The blade has a thick layer of frosting on the left side and the other side is brown, its guard and handle is brown. The knife is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] in this stage.

=== Variant 2 ===
The second variant is similar to the first stage, though it contains more details, the blade contains frosting but it has a wiggly pattern, its guard is white, with frosting and the handle has a stripy red and white pattern similar to a candy cane, the knife is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] in this stage.

=== Variant 3 ===
The third variant turns into a [[Godly Weapons|godly]], its shape resembles looks a lot like a pirate cutlass, the blade has frosting containing a pattern and the base of the knife is brown it also contains little bits of candy, the guard has a “C” shape with a stripy white pattern on the middle of the guard, the handle has a stripy pattern that looks like a candy cane. This variant shares a few similarities with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Cookiecane]].

=== Variant 4 ===
The fourth variant is when the knife turns into an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] weapon. It has a brown gingerbread base, the frosting contains more vivid patterns and there are still small bits of candy in the right side of the blade, the handle has another longer candy cane pattern.

== Trivia ==
* This is the third [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] knife to be added in the game.
* This, [[Reaver]], [[Icecrusher]], and [[Synthwave]] are the only gamepass knives to be untradeable.
* It pairs with the [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] gun [[Gingerscope]].
* This knife also has [[Unique Weapons|unique]] counterparts, those being the [[Gold Gingerscythe|gold]], [[Silver Gingerscythe|silver]], [[Bronze Gingerscythe|bronze]] and [[Blue Gingerscythe|blue]] version. All of them use the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] variant of the knife.
* The ancient variant of Gingerscythe has the biggest hitbox in the game, being the only weapon to have a bigger hitbox than [[Icewing]].
* This is one of the few scythes in game, the others being [[Nik's Scythe]], [[Batwing]], [[Icewing]], [[Elderwood Scythe]], [[Hallowscythe]], [[Reaver]], and [[Synthwave]].
* This is the second [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] to have leaderboard variants. The first one being [[Icecrusher]], and the third being [[Synthwave]].

